<Slide notes={`Three trials per arm, same questions, same seeds, same prompts. Overall 30.39 to 29.61 — no overall effect. Multi-hop is the only category that moves the predicted way: 27.39 to 23.05, minus 4.33, where the paper reports minus 21.3. The direction reproduces; the magnitude is a fifth. And the mechanism injects variance: on multi-hop, the full arm's spread is 3.48 versus 0.71 without it.`} style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Arial' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', marginLeft: 60 }}>Ablation: direction yes, magnitude no</Text>
    <Text style={{ color: '#B8C7E6', fontSize: 16, marginLeft: 'auto', marginRight: 60 }}>FTEC5660 · Reproducibility</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 676, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ color: '#8B97A8', fontSize: 14 }}>Reproducing A-MEM on LoCoMo</Text>
    <Text style={{ color: '#8B97A8', fontSize: 14 }}>13 / 16</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 64, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 606, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, paddingTop: 34, paddingBottom: 40 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1.1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ color: '#1E4FA8', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1, marginBottom: 14 }}>DISABLE MEMORY EVOLUTION — F1 BY CATEGORY</Text>
      <Table
        style={{ width: '100%', height: 440 }}
        defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 16, textAlign: 'left', color: '#1A2230' }}
        defaultCellStyle={{ border: { bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' } } }}
        cells={[
          [
            { text: 'Category', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: 'Full', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8', textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: 'w/o evolution', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8', textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: 'Δ (ours)', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8', textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
            { text: 'Δ (paper)', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1E4FA8', textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
          ],
          ['Single-hop', { text: '44.00', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '42.55', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '-1.45', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '—', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }],
          ['Multi-hop', { text: '27.39', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '23.05', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '-4.33', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right', color: '#D9534F', bold: true } }, { text: '-21.30', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right', color: '#D9534F', bold: true } }],
          ['Temporal', { text: '20.17', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '23.98', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '+3.82', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '—', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }],
          ['Open-domain', { text: '10.25', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '11.77', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '+1.52', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '—', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }],
          ['Adversarial', { text: '25.76', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '24.16', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '-1.60', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }, { text: '—', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' } }],
          [
            { text: 'Overall', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#1A2230' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
            { text: '30.39', textStyle: { bold: true, textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
            { text: '29.61', textStyle: { bold: true, textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
            { text: '-0.78', textStyle: { bold: true, textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
            { text: '—', textStyle: { textAlign: 'right' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
          ],
        ]}
      />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 0.9, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ color: '#1A2230', fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', marginBottom: 16 }}>The mechanism is real, but small.</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: '#4A5568', fontSize: 20, lineHeight: 1.5, marginBottom: 14 }}>Multi-hop moves the predicted way (−4.33), a <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>fifth</span> of the paper's −21.30.</Text>
      <Text style={{ color: '#4A5568', fontSize: 20, lineHeight: 1.5, marginBottom: 18 }}>Overall −0.78, against a pooled standard error of 1.6 — not separable from noise at three trials.</Text>
      <Box style={{ borderTop: '1px solid #D6DCE5', paddingTop: 18 }}>
        <Text style={{ color: '#1E4FA8', fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1, marginBottom: 10 }}>THE MECHANISM INJECTS VARIANCE</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 20 }}>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ color: '#4A5568', fontSize: 16 }}>full (std)</Text>
            <Text style={{ color: '#1A2230', fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>3.48</Text>
          </Box>
          <Text style={{ color: '#8B97A8', fontSize: 26 }}>vs</Text>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ color: '#4A5568', fontSize: 16 }}>w/o evolution (std)</Text>
            <Text style={{ color: '#1E4FA8', fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1 }}>0.71</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
